{"time": 1752995097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "457676334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "使用二级怪物召唤术，“唔...这个地方果然有更多同伴会更好吧。”枷薇则是对自己的真红使用了魔牙术强化"}
{"time": 1752995133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1156087368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...小心一些”"}
{"time": 1752995243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1501653110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "召唤几只小狗"}
