{"time": 1753113366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "673107666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那么你注意到在瓷砖地板上发现一些类似粘液的痕迹，这些粘液残留物在C9，C10和C10的门之间都留下了痕迹"}
{"time": 1753113403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "384933052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"粘液?\"指挥一只鼠鼠踩上去"}
